[{"id":162505259,"discussion_id":"f893c54911a628fa27b4b7508d817f7fb840c92c","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2) (2/2) | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-06T20:58:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T10:16:11+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162505268,"discussion_id":"f2cda0cbc121b674034c3756ceadb2b637bab434","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-06T20:58:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T20:58:13+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162505388,"discussion_id":"b09252bafe52b03c52631d97b46330fb8cab95f8","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要对`EmbeddingBag`算子进行了两项核心增强与修复。第一，增强了算子的形状推断功能，使其能够支持输入张量（权重、索引、偏移量）为未知形状或未知秩的动态图场景，提升了算子在输入维度信息不全时的鲁棒性。第二，修复了算子中`padding_idx`参数处理逻辑的错误，确保该参数能被正确读取，并支持负索引值到有效正索引的转换，保证了算子功能的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案包含两部分。首先，在形状推断函数`InferShapeForEmbeddingBagSupport`中，新增并重构了四个专用的形状推断支持函数，根据输入张量的实际维度及`mode`属性，动态地为所有输出设置正确的维度值或未知标记，从而完善了动态输入下的形状推断逻辑。其次，修复了`GetShapeAttrsInfo`函数中读取`padding_idx`属性的错误，将其属性键更正为`ATTR_PADD_INDEX`，并增加了对负值`padding_idx`的处理，使其能正确转换为有效索引。此外，在算子的核函数初始化阶段，为`EmbeddingBagRegBaseIndx1dMean`和`EmbeddingBagRegBaseIndx1dSum`类新增了中间计算缓冲区`maxIndicesCalcBuf_`，以支持内部计算需求。","created_at":"2026-02-06T20:59:43+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T20:59:43+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162522545,"discussion_id":"53792b9b3cafc2ea0052fb60a8ca3244616ab97b","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-07T11:13:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-07T11:13:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162522563,"discussion_id":"de57d66a5d618248de1ebb951a92cba649cd9707","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-07T11:13:2